{"id":"vod_sn_37750","vodId":"37750","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"化物语","name_cn":"化物语","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/404e0fb37cea4cad8b14ca22d77c66fe.jpg"},"summary":"三年同班同学却没有说过一句话，这指得就是阿良良木历（神谷浩史 配音）和战场原黑仪（斋藤千和 配音）。二人虽是同班同学，但可以说没有任何交集。本以为就会这样一直下去的阿良良木历因为一次偶然接住了意外从楼梯上跌下来的黑仪。而这次意外的从天而降，让历知道了黑仪的秘密。而这个秘密牵扯到众多事情，虽然历发誓自己绝不会把这件事告诉任何人，但黑仪还是表示怀疑。而历也向黑仪透露出自己的小秘密。但这个城市并不是只有二人拥有神奇的力量。许多奇怪的生物和事情正在向二人靠拢。　　本剧根据日本小说家西尾维新的同名轻小说改编。《化物语》曾获得2009年“这本轻小说真厉害！”票选活动第六名。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":15,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8qvzcNF5Eb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2sS0yXfYP01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/33jLw2aDwF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jWG0TPvGKH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8kCn1bDBSM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8XKCgPRsQS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HhzDLDyAKW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vHKNzy8wVM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QQmn9hzigj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eK5sENbY9f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bShFPnjiMV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yf67WN9eef1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vhMW2uTL8Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jBHRNGG7jR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url"